{
  "format": 1,
  "entries": [
    {
      "key": "TUT_ADDON_TECHNOMANCY",
      "pages": [
        {
          "id": "technomancy:tut_addon_technomancy/text/1",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.technomancy.tut_addon_technomancy.text.1",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "量子魔法是什么\n",
                  "bold": true
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "technomancy:tut_addon_technomancy/text/2",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.technomancy.tut_addon_technomancy.text.2",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "量子魔法把神秘时代和"
                },
                {
                  "text": "能源",
                  "bold": true
                },
                {
                  "text": "结合起来：把节点或魔力转化为电能，再用电能凝聚魔力、甚至"
                },
                {
                  "text": "制造新的节点",
                  "bold": true
                },
                {
                  "text": "。它还提供量子罐、无线源质线圈、神秘冶炼炉和生物群系转换器。\n"
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "technomancy:tut_addon_technomancy/divider/3",
          "type": "DIVIDER"
        },
        {
          "id": "technomancy:tut_addon_technomancy/text/4",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.technomancy.tut_addon_technomancy.text.4",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "从哪里开始\n",
                  "bold": true
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "technomancy:tut_addon_technomancy/text/5",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.technomancy.tut_addon_technomancy.text.5",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "technomancy:TECHNOBASICS"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：神秘量子科学，自动解锁。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "technomancy:DYNAMO"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：神秘能源炉，从节点或魔力发电。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "technomancy:QUANTUMJARS"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：量子罐，大容量源质储存。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "technomancy:CONDENSER"
                },
                {
                  "text": "、"
                },
                {
                  "research": "technomancy:NODEGENERATOR"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：凝聚能源与节点创造。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "technomancy:PROCESSOR"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：神秘冶炼炉，矿物翻倍加工。\n"
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "technomancy:tut_addon_technomancy/text/6",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.technomancy.tut_addon_technomancy.text.6",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "安装了植物魔法：会出现「植物魔法机器」研究。\n"
                }
              ]
            ]
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "forge:mod_loaded",
              "modid": "botania"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "technomancy:tut_addon_technomancy/text/7",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.technomancy.tut_addon_technomancy.text.7",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "安装了血魔法：会出现「血魔法机器」研究。\n"
                }
              ]
            ]
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "forge:mod_loaded",
              "modid": "bloodmagic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "technomancy:tut_addon_technomancy/recommended/divider",
          "type": "DIVIDER"
        },
        {
          "id": "technomancy:tut_addon_technomancy/recommended/title",
